# iCloud Drive conflict duplicates. This repo commonly lives on a synced
# Desktop, and iCloud races build.sh's rm -rf + cp when staging Mods/,
# leaving "Foo 2.dll" next to "Foo.dll". release-framework.sh runs a bare
# `git add prebuilt/`, so without this they can ride along into a release.
* 2.*
